>> list := Uhlu okusha.
list ~ ['hello'].
Okuphumayo bhala: list inani.
list engeza-ekugcineni: ['world'].
Okuphumayo bhala: list inani.
Okuphumayo bhala: list thatha-yokugcina, bhala: list inani.
list engeza-ekugcineni: ['there'].
Okuphumayo bhala: list inani.
Okuphumayo bhala: (list indawo: 0), bhala: (list indawo: 1).
list beka: ['xmas'] endaweni: 1.
list beka: ['merry'] endaweni: 0.
Okuphumayo bhala: list inani.
Okuphumayo bhala: (list indawo: 0), bhala: (list indawo: 1).
